; caldera_chimney_base.room - basalt chamber where the orchard cliff chimney lands (design 04 section 3.7).
; No gate: the west opening continues as the floor; stone only (the Caldera has no earth).
; A double-jump nook in the ceiling block: a shelf (row 3, cols 5-11) under a [secret] hollow (cols 8-10, rows 1-2, cracked at
; col 8, col 11 its back) with a reward slot (`$`, WORLD-35) and a stone [back] wall, as an enclosed hollow shows rock (WORLD-31).
; Off the walking line by design (bugs/the-caldera-chimney-base-false-floor-lies-on-the-only-route).
; The bench (col 6, WORLD-35) is where a chimney arrival lands, 11 screens from the crater bench before it.

